#. Paragraph on how public resume links work
#: src/routes/_home/terms.tsx
msgid "A resume is private until you publish it. Publishing creates a URL that anyone with the link can open, and an optional password protects it; unpublishing takes it down again. Do not put anything in a published resume that you would not want the open internet to read."
msgstr "履歷在您發布之前是私有的。發布後會產生一個網址，任何拿到網址的人都能開啟，您也可以選擇加上密碼保護；取消發布即可撤下。不要在任何已發布的履歷裡寫下您不希望公開網際網路看到的內容。"

#: src/features/ats-checker/parse-preview.tsx
msgid "A resume laid out for a human reader, with a photo, headings and columns"
msgstr "為人類讀者設計的履歷排版，帶照片、標題和分欄"

#: src/features/ats-checker/parse-preview.tsx
msgid "A single-column export keeps every fact. Columns and images are where facts get lost."
msgstr "單欄輸出能保留每一項資訊。資訊容易漏掉的地方是分欄與圖片。"

