#. Paragraph on the hashed send log and its rate-limiting and audit purpose
#: src/routes/_home/privacy.tsx
msgid "Each message leaves a row in this deployment's own send log, and that row does not hold your number or your IP address in a readable form: it holds a keyed HMAC digest of each, from which the original cannot be recovered. The log is what makes the limits enforceable — a cooldown of sixty seconds between codes, ten messages per number per day, and twenty per IP address per hour — and what lets an operator trace abuse after the fact. It is not a record of anything you wrote, and it is not used for anything else."
msgstr "每一則簡訊都會在本實例自己的發送日誌裡留下一個記錄,而這個記錄並不以可讀形式保存你的手機號碼或 IP 位址:它保存的是各自的帶金鑰 HMAC 摘要,無法從中還原出原始值。這份日誌是限額得以執行的前提 —— 兩次驗證碼之間需間隔六十秒、每個號碼每天十則、每個 IP 位址每小時二十則 —— 也是事後追溯濫用行為的依據。它不記錄你寫下的任何內容,也不用於其他用途。"

