msgstr "如果是掃描檔導致的，這屬於正常情況。否則請刪除它；招募人員會把它當作關鍵詞堆砌。"

#. Paragraph on what a phone number is stored as and what it is used for
#: src/routes/_home/privacy.tsx
msgid "If this instance has phone sign-in enabled and you choose to use it, your number is stored in international format: a leading plus sign, then the country code, then the rest of the number, as in +8613800138000. Alongside it sits a flag recording whether the number has been confirmed by a code you entered. It is used for signing you in and for getting you back into an account you cannot otherwise reach. It is not used to send you marketing, and it is not handed to anyone for that purpose."
msgstr "如果本實例啟用了手機號碼登入且你選擇使用它,你的號碼會以國際格式保存:一個加號,接著國碼,再接著號碼其餘部分,例如 +8613800138000。旁邊還有一個標記,記錄該號碼是否已經透過你輸入的驗證碼確認過。它用於讓你登入,以及在你無法透過其他方式進入帳號時幫你取回帳號。它不會被用來向你發送行銷資訊,也不會為此交給任何一方。"

#. Paragraph on which SMS provider carries the code and why the number reaches it
#: src/routes/_home/privacy.tsx
msgid "If this instance has phone sign-in enabled, the one-time codes arrive as text messages sent by whichever provider the operator of this instance has configured and holds a contract with, which is one of Alibaba Cloud SMS or Tencent Cloud SMS. A code cannot be delivered without that provider receiving your number, because the number is the address the message goes to. Which of the two is in use is the operator's choice and not something this page can state on their behalf; ask them if you need to know."
msgstr "如果本實例啟用了手機號碼登入,驗證碼簡訊由本實例營運者所設定並簽約的服務商投遞,即阿里雲簡訊或騰訊雲簡訊之一。簡訊要送達,服務商就必須收到你的號碼,因為號碼本身就是簡訊的收件位址。具體使用哪一家由營運者決定,本頁無法代為說明;如需瞭解,請直接詢問營運者。"

#. Paragraph on the identifiers WeChat and Alipay return, and the absence of an email address
#: src/routes/_home/privacy.tsx
msgid "If this instance offers WeChat or Alipay sign-in and you use it, those services confirm who you are without handing over an email address. What they return is an identifier: an openid or a unionid from WeChat, a user_id from Alipay. It is stable for you within that service and means nothing outside it. That identifier is what gets stored and linked to your account. Because an email address is required on every account in this software, an account created this way is given a placeholder address generated for it. It is not a mailbox you can receive mail at, and nothing is sent to it."
msgstr "如果本實例提供微信或支付寶登入且你使用它,這兩家服務會在不提供電子郵件地址的情況下確認你的身分。它們回傳的是一個識別碼:微信回傳 openid 或 unionid,支付寶回傳 user_id。該識別碼在該服務內對你保持穩定,出了該服務則沒有任何含義。保存並與你的帳號關聯的正是這個識別碼。由於本軟體要求每個帳號都有電子郵件地址,以這種方式建立的帳號會被分配一個為它產生的佔位電子郵件地址。它不是一個可以收信的郵箱,也不會向它發送任何郵件。"

