#. Paragraph explaining the optional AI features and what they send
#: src/routes/_home/privacy.tsx
msgid "The AI features are optional, and off unless an administrator enables them. When they are on, a check sends what that check needs — the resume text you submit to it — to the model provider configured for this instance, and nothing else."
msgstr "AI 功能是選用的，只有在管理員啟用後才會開啟。開啟後，某次檢查只會把該次檢查所需的內容——即您提交給它的履歷文字——傳送給本實例所設定的模型服務商，不會傳送其他內容。"

#: src/features/auth/pages/error.tsx
msgid "The application that sent you here made an invalid authorization request."
msgstr "將您導向至此的應用程式提出了無效的授權要求。"

#: src/features/ats-checker/ai-review/ai-review-card.tsx
msgid "The checks above are mechanical. This asks a language model what a reader would think of your bullets, and suggests rewrites. It produces no score."
msgstr "以上檢查都是機械化的規則判斷。這項功能會詢問語言模型，看讀者會如何看待您的重點，並提出改寫建議。它不會給出分數。"

