#. Opening paragraph of the privacy policy
#: src/routes/_home/privacy.tsx
msgid "This instance of Reactive Resume is a self-hosted resume builder. This page says what the software stores, why, and what you can ask to have done with it. It describes this deployment's defaults: an administrator who switches on extra integrations changes the picture, and the sections below say where. If you need an answer specific to this instance, ask whoever runs it."
msgstr "本 Reactive Resume 實例是一套自託管的履歷製作工具。本頁說明軟體會儲存什麼、為什麼儲存，以及您可以要求如何處理。它描述的是本部署的預設行為：管理員一旦啟用額外的整合服務，情況會有所不同，下面各節會指出是哪些地方。如需瞭解本實例的具體情況，請聯繫其營運方。"

#: src/features/ats-checker/messages.ts
msgid "This is a PDF Portfolio: the visible page is only a cover."
msgstr "這是一個 PDF Portfolio（PDF 作品集包）：可見的頁面只是封面。"

#: src/features/homepage/feature-explorer.tsx
